# npm packaging — staged by scripts/stage-npm.mjs at pack time so the published
# tarball root IS the module root. The source of truth is the inner
# {{ cookiecutter.package_name }}/ directory; these copies are never committed.
# Leaving one behind puts a manifest.yaml at the repository root, which every
# Filament tool then discovers as a second module.
/manifest.yaml
/schemas/
/skeletons/
/mappings.yaml
/examples/
*.tgz
